oad  the starter project  files inside which is the template 3d  scene as well as an example render which  you can use to compare  your render to to make sure you are  following the rules very specifically  and also there's a link to my discord  server in the description  and on the landing page where you guys  can share your work and troubleshoot  certain roadblocks  with other like-minded artists to submit  your art i'll be posting a submission  link two weeks into this challenge on  the landing page  and my discord server august 1st 11 59  pm  pst is the deadline i will be live  streaming my process  today at 10 45 am pst  come join me let's hang out let's figure  out what we're going to do together  and i can't wait to see how this turns  out so i'll see you guys soon  peace  [Music]  you
 

